(`a_follower_that_refused_an_append_does_not_acknowledge_it_afterwards`) starts from a node whose
`agreed` is already zero, so the reset the mutant removes was a no-op there and the mutant changed
nothing observable. A surviving mutant is a missing test, not a tolerable one.

